        <div class="section-leading-center-2">
          <h1 class="landing-h1">Everything you need for the perfect packaging.</h1> 
  <p class="bottom-mobile-40">PackOasis has provided custom packaging solutions to a wide range of businesses worldwide. Built on experience working with a wide range of industries, we have curated a library of material options based on their capabilities for your convenience below. 
