            <div class="section-content">    
    <div class="section-opt">
  <div class="row">
  <div class="col-lg-8">
  <h2>Print Methods</h2>
  <p>Available printing methods to achieve your unique look.</p>
  </div>
  </div>
  
   <hr class="option-hr"> 
  
  <div class="options-items">
  <div class="flex-grid-row-option">
  
  <div class="flex-grid-item-option">
  <div class="material-box"> 
  <a href="/offset-printing.html"><img class="porto-lazyload" loading='lazy'  data-src="/media.pakfactory.com/media_upload/coding_guide/printer-1.jpg" alt="Offset Printing">
  <div class="material-des">
  <h3 class="new-subtitl">Offset Print</h3>
  <p>A printing plate and rubber blanket is used to transfer designs to paper for high-quality printing. </p>
  </div>
  </a>
  </div>
  </div>
  <div class="flex-grid-item-option">
  <div class="material-box"> 
  <a href="/flexography-printing.html"><img class="porto-lazyload" loading='lazy'  data-src="/media.pakfactory.com/media_upload/coding_guide/printer-2.jpg" alt="Flexography Printing">
  <div class="material-des">
  <h3 class="new-subtitl">Flexography Print</h3>
  <p>Rubber printing plates are used to stamp designs on paper for cost and time efficient printing. </p>
  </div>
  </a>
  </div>
  </div>
  <div class="flex-grid-item-option">
  <div class="material-box"> 
  <a href="/gravure-printing.html"><img class="porto-lazyload" loading='lazy'  data-src="/media.pakfactory.com/media_upload/coding_guide/printer-3.jpg" alt="Gravure Printing">
  <div class="material-des">
  <h3 class="new-subtitl">Gravure Print</h3>
  <p>A printing plate with micro-cavaties is used to transfer designs on paper and plastic for high-quality prints. </p>
  </div>
  </a>
  </div>
  </div>
  <div class="flex-grid-item-option">
  <div class="material-box"> 
  <a href="/digital-printing.html"><img class="porto-lazyload" loading='lazy'  data-src="/media.pakfactory.com/media_upload/coding_guide/printer-4.jpg" alt="Digital Printing">
  <div class="material-des">
  <h3 class="new-subtitl">Digital Print</h3>
  <p>Transferred electronically requiring no printing plates for cost and time efficient printing. </p>
  </div>
  </a>
  </div>
  </div>
  <div class="flex-grid-item-option">
  <div class="material-box"> 
  <a href="/screen-silk-printing.html"><img class="porto-lazyload" loading='lazy'  data-src="/media.pakfactory.com/media_upload/coding_guide/printer-5.jpg" alt="Screen / Silk Printing">
  <div class="material-des">
  <h3 class="new-subtitl">Silk Screen Print</h3>
  <p>Stenciling printing method using stacked layers of color. Commonly used for one to two color prints. </p>
  </div>
  </a>
  </div>
  </div>
  <div class="flex-grid-item-option">
  <div class="material-box"> 
  <a href="/uv-printing.html"><img class="porto-lazyload" loading='lazy'  data-src="/media.pakfactory.com/media_upload/coding_guide/printer-6.jpg" alt="UV Printing">
  <div class="material-des">
  <h3 class="new-subtitl">UV Print</h3>
  <p>Fast-drying printing method using ultraviolet lights to cure inks which results in a gloss finish. </p>
  </div>
  </a>
  </div>
  </div>
  <div class="flex-grid-item-option">
  <div class="material-box"> 
  <a href="/laser-engraving.html"><img class="porto-lazyload" loading='lazy'  data-src="/media.pakfactory.com/media_upload/coding_guide/printer-7.jpg" alt="Laser Engraving">
  <div class="material-des">
  <h3 class="new-subtitl">Laser Engraving</h3>
  <p>Quick engraving process utilizing a high heat laser to vaporize designs on the surface of any material. </p>
  </div>
  </a>
  </div>
  </div>

  
  
  </div>
  </div><!---end of option item-->
  
  </div>
