  <h3 class="new-subtitl">Thumb Cut-out</h3>
  <p>Added to tuck top designs, a notch is die-cut to create an easy and convenient unboxing experience. </p>
  </div>
  </a>
  </div>
  </div>
  <div class="flex-grid-item-option">
  <div class="material-box"> <a href="/style-detail-tab-lock.html"><img class="porto-lazyload" loading='lazy'  data-src="/media.pakfactory.com/media_upload/coding_guide/style-detail-29.png" alt="Tab Lock">
  <div class="material-des">
  <h3 class="new-subtitl">Tab Lock</h3>
  <p>Tuck top design features two tabs and two slits for secure sealing and easy unboxing. </p>
  </div>
  </a>
  </div>
  </div>
  <div class="flex-grid-item-option">
  <div class="material-box"> <a href="/style-detail-mailer-lock.html"><img class="porto-lazyload" loading='lazy'  data-src="/media.pakfactory.com/media_upload/coding_guide/style-detail-30.png" alt="Mailer Lock">
  <div class="material-des">
  <h3 class="new-subtitl">Mailer Lock</h3>
  <p>Unique tuck top design featuring a long panel and a tab for secure sealing. </p>
  </div>
  </a>
  </div>
  </div>
  <div class="flex-grid-item-option">
  <div class="material-box"> <a href="/style-detail-tongue-lock.html"><img class="porto-lazyload" loading='lazy'  data-src="/media.pakfactory.com/media_upload/coding_guide/style-detail-42.png" alt="Tongue lock / Catalog lock">
  <div class="material-des">
  <h3 class="new-subtitl">Tongue Lock / Catalog Lock</h3>
  <p>Tuck top design featuring a slit that locks with the panel to create a secure top. </p>
  </div>
  </a>
  </div>
  </div>
  <div class="flex-grid-item-option">
  <div class="material-box"> <a href="/style-detail-window-cutout.html"><img class="porto-lazyload" loading='lazy'  data-src="/media.pakfactory.com/media_upload/coding_guide/style-detail-39.png" alt="Window Cut-out">
  
  <div class="material-des">
  <h3 class="new-subtitl">Window Cut-out</h3>
  <p>A shape is removed from the front of a box and covered with clear thin plastic to showcase products. </p>
  </div>
  </a>
  </div>
  </div>
  <div class="flex-grid-item-option">
  <div class="material-box"> <a href="/style-detail-hang-tab.html"><img class="porto-lazyload" loading='lazy'  data-src="/media.pakfactory.com/media_upload/coding_guide/style-detail-31.png" alt="Hang Tab">
  <div class="material-des">
  <h3 class="new-subtitl">Hang Tab</h3>
  <p>Tuck top or seal end design featuring a slit with a tab designed for hanging a box. </p>
  </div>
  </a>
  </div>
  </div>
  <div class="flex-grid-item-option">
  <div class="material-box"> <a href="/style-detail-hanger-detail.html"><img class="porto-lazyload" loading='lazy'  data-src="/media.pakfactory.com/media_upload/coding_guide/style-detail-32.png" alt="Hanger">
  <div class="material-des">
  <h3 class="new-subtitl">Hanger</h3>
  <p>Tuck top or seal end design featuring an extra panel on the back of a box for hanging. </p>
  </div>
  </a>
  </div>
  </div>
  
  <div class="flex-grid-item-option">
  <div class="material-box"> <a href="/style-detail-side-hang-tab.html"><img class="porto-lazyload" loading='lazy'  data-src="/media.pakfactory.com/media_upload/coding_guide/style-detail-33.png" alt="Side Hang Tab">
  <div class="material-des">
  <h3 class="new-subtitl">Side Hang Tab</h3>
  <p>Tuck top or seal end design featuring an extra panel on the side of a box for hanging. </p>
  </div>
  </a>
  </div>
  </div>
  <div class="flex-grid-item-option">
  <div class="material-box"> <a href="/style-detail-dispenser.html"><img class="porto-lazyload" loading='lazy'  data-src="/media.pakfactory.com/media_upload/coding_guide/style-detail-34.png" alt="Dispenser">
  <div class="material-des">
  <h3 class="new-subtitl">Dispenser</h3>
  <p>Tuck top, auto bottom, or seal end design featuring a perforated area in the front panel for dispensing. </p>
  </div>
  </a>
  </div>
  </div>
  
  <div class="flex-grid-item-option">
  <div class="material-box"> <a href="/style-detail-hand-hole.html"><img class="porto-lazyload" loading='lazy'  data-src="/media.pakfactory.com/media_upload/coding_guide/style-detail-36.png" alt="Hand Hole">
  <div class="material-des">
  <h3 class="new-subtitl">Hand Hole</h3>
  <p>Gusset design featuring a die-cut hole for carrying and handling packaging at ease. </p>
  </div>
  </a>
  </div>
  </div>
  
  <div class="flex-grid-item-option">
  <div class="material-box"> <a href="/style-detail-adhesive-strip.html"><img class="porto-lazyload" loading='lazy'  data-src="/media.pakfactory.com/media_upload/coding_guide/style-detail-25.png" alt="Adhesive Strip">
  <div class="material-des">
  <h3 class="new-subtitl">Adhesive Strip</h3>
  <p>Added to seal end packaging to offer convenient sealing or returnability of products. </p>
  </div>
  </a>
  </div>
  </div>
  
  
  
  <div class="flex-grid-item-option">
  <div class="material-box"> <a href="/style-detail-tear-strip.html"><img class="porto-lazyload" loading='lazy'  data-src="/media.pakfactory.com/media_upload/coding_guide/style-detail-37.png" alt="Tear Strip">
  <div class="material-des">
  <h3 class="new-subtitl">Tear Strip</h3>
  <p>Perforated strip on the outer panel that can be peeled back for a satisfying unboxing experience. </p>
  </div>
  </a>
  </div>
  </div>
  
  
  
  <div class="flex-grid-item-option">
  <div class="material-box"> <a href="/style-detail-child-resistant-lock.html"><img class="porto-lazyload" loading='lazy'  data-src="/media.pakfactory.com/media_upload/coding_guide/style-detail-41.png" alt="Child Resistant Lock">
  
  <div class="material-des">
  <h3 class="new-subtitl">Child Resistant Lock</h3>
  <p>Matchbox design featuring a lock for child safety unlocked by pressing down a side tab.  </p>
  </div>
  </a>
  </div>
  </div>
  
  <div class="flex-grid-item-option">
  <div class="material-box"> <a href="/style-detail-corner-punch-out.html"><img class="porto-lazyload" loading='lazy'  data-src="/media.pakfactory.com/media_upload/coding_guide/style-detail-43.png" alt="Corner Punch Out">
  <div class="material-des">
  <h3 class="new-subtitl">Corner Punch Out</h3>
  <p>Added to a range of boxes to create a filler space for products to rest on and remain in place. </p>
  </div>
  </a>
  </div>
  </div>
  <div class="flex-grid-item-option">
  <div class="material-box"> <a href="/style-detail-anchor-lock.html"><img class="porto-lazyload" loading='lazy'  data-src="/media.pakfactory.com/media_upload/coding_guide/style-detail-44.png" alt="Anchor Lock">
  <div class="material-des">
  <h3 class="new-subtitl">Anchor Lock</h3>
  <p>Tuck top design featuring a slit for the panel to lock onto to create secure sealing capabilities. </p>
  </div>
  </a>
  </div>
  </div>
  <div class="flex-grid-item-option">
  <div class="material-box"> <a href="/style-detail-perforation.html"><img class="porto-lazyload" loading='lazy'  data-src="/media.pakfactory.com/media_upload/coding_guide/style-detail-46.png" alt="Perforation">
  <div class="material-des">
  <h3 class="new-subtitl">Perforation</h3>
  <p>Small holes on the surface of a paper material to provide a convenient way to tear open. </p>
  </div>
  </a>
  </div>
  </div>
  
  
  </div>
  </div><!---end of option item-->
  
  </div>
   
  </div>
         
          
      
      
      </div><!---end of tab content -->
             
      <div class="item title" data-role="collapsible">
          <a class="switch" data-toggle="trigger" href="#tab-5"><img src="/media/media_upload/coding_guide/handle-icon.svg" style="width: 22px;" alt="print"/> Bag Handles</a>
      </div>
      <div id="tab-5" class="item content" data-role="content">
         <div class="section-content">    
    <div class="section-opt">
  <div class="row">
  <div class="col-lg-6">
  <h2>Paper Bag Handles</h2>
  <p>Bag handles made with organic and inorganic materials primarily used for paper bags. </p>
  </div>
  </div>
  
   <hr class="option-hr"> 
  
  <div class="options-items">
  <div class="flex-grid-row-option">
  
  <div class="flex-grid-item-option">
  <div class="material-box"> 
  <a href="/paper-bag-handles-twisted-polypropylene.html"><img class="porto-lazyload" loading='lazy'  data-src="/media.pakfactory.com/media_upload/coding_guide/handles-2.jpg" alt="UV Coating">
  <div class="material-des">
  <h3 class="new-subtitl">Polypropylene Rope</h3>
  <p>Water-resistant and lightweight rope made from twisted polypropylene string for added strength.
  </p>
  </div>
  </a>
  </div>
  </div>
    <div class="flex-grid-item-option">
  <div class="material-box"> 
  <a href="/paper-bag-handles-nylon.html"><img class="porto-lazyload" loading='lazy'  data-src="/media.pakfactory.com/media_upload/coding_guide/handles-6.jpg" alt="Varnish">
  <div class="material-des">
  <h3 class="new-subtitl">Nylon Rope</h3>
  <p>UV resistant rope made from nylon string for maximum strength to support heavier weights. </p>
  </div>
  </a>
  </div>
  </div>
  <div class="flex-grid-item-option">
  <div class="material-box"> 
  <a href="/paper-bag-handles-cotton-string.html"><img class="porto-lazyload" loading='lazy'  data-src="/media.pakfactory.com/media_upload/coding_guide/handles-8.jpg" alt="Varnish">
  <div class="material-des">
  <h3 class="new-subtitl">Cotton Rope</h3>
  <p>A soft cotton rope made from woven cotton for added tensile strength for medium weights. </p>
  </div>
  </a>
  </div>
  </div>
  
  
  <div class="flex-grid-item-option">
  <div class="material-box"> 
  <a href="/paper-bag-handles-grosgrain-polyester.html"><img class="porto-lazyload" loading='lazy'  data-src="/media.pakfactory.com/media_upload/coding_guide/handles-7.jpg" alt="Varnish">
  <div class="material-des">
  <h3 class="new-subtitl">Grosgrain Ribbon</h3>
  <p>High-quality ribbon-like material made from a combination of fibers for a luxurious look and feel.  </p>
  </div>
  </a>
  </div>
  </div>
  
    <div class="flex-grid-item-option">
  <div class="material-box"> 
  <a href="/paper-bag-handles-twisted-paper.html"><img class="porto-lazyload" loading='lazy'  data-src="/media.pakfactory.com/media_upload/coding_guide/handles-4.jpg" alt="Soft Touch Coating">
  <div class="material-des">
  <h3 class="new-subtitl">Twisted Paper</h3>
  <p>Fully recyclable material from dense and durable twisted kraft paper for added strength. </p>
  </div>
  </a>
  </div>
  </div>
  <div class="flex-grid-item-option">
  <div class="material-box"> 
  <a href="/paper-bag-handles-die-cut.html"><img class="porto-lazyload" loading='lazy'  data-src="/media.pakfactory.com/media_upload/coding_guide/handles-1.jpg" alt="Aqueous Coating">
  <div class="material-des">
  <h3 class="new-subtitl">Die-cut</h3>
  <p>Cut-out made with a custom die for a cost effective and unique handle bag handle option. </p>
  </div>
  </a>
  </div>
  </div>
  <div class="flex-grid-item-option">
  <div class="material-box"> 
  <a href="/paper-bag-handles-flat-paper.html"><img class="porto-lazyload" loading='lazy'  data-src="/media.pakfactory.com/media_upload/coding_guide/handles-3.jpg" alt="Spot Gloss UV">
  <div class="material-des">
  <h3 class="new-subtitl">Flat Paper</h3>
  <p>Standard flat paper handles made from matching paper material for carrying light weights. </p>
  </div>
  </a>
  </div>
  </div>
  
  </div>
  </div><!---end of option item-->
  
  </div>
  
  </div>
          
          </div> <!---end of tab content -->
  </div>
