          <div class="clear" ></div>
           
               <p class="sub-title">Tailored solutions</p>
               <h2 class="title-36">A solution for every industry.</h2>
               <p>PackOasis has come to know the intricacies of many different industries and has extensive experience providing packaging solutions to businesses worldwide. </p>
               
               <div class="stroke-btm-wrap"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-stroke" href="/packaging-by-industry.html"> Explore industry solutions</a></div>
               
            </div>
